### WATCHLIST TESTING 
### 1. Create watchlist item — no alert
POST http://localhost:3000/api/watchlist
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6IjZhMDk1MjA5M2Q2MGNmMmQ2NDMyNDRjNyIsImlhdCI6MTc3ODk5NzI3MywiZXhwIjoxNzc4OTk3ODczfQ.ikY7dY4KQLu-qShO2nMf9roCDUZTHjt3g0v2XUXv37w

{
  "symbol": "NABIL",
  "exchange": "NEPSE",
  "action": "Buy",
  "priority": "High",
  "notes": "Waiting for dip below 900"
}

### 2. Create watchlist item — with price alert
POST http://localhost:3000/api/watchlist
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer .

{
  "symbol": "A200",
  "exchange": "ASX",
  "action": "Buy",
  "priority": "Medium",
  "priceAlertThreshold": 95.00,
  "alertDirection": "below"
}

### 3. Get all watchlist items
GET http://localhost:3000/api/watchlist
Authorization: Bearer .

### 4. Get single item — paste _id from above
GET http://localhost:3000/api/watchlist/6a095ae96bb945c992c02072
Authorization: Bearer .

### 5. Update — mark alert triggered
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/watchlist/6a095ae96bb945c992c02072
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer .

{
  "alertTriggered": true
}

### 6. Delete
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/watchlist/6a095ae96bb945c992c02072
Authorization: Bearer .

### 7. Validation — alertDirection without threshold, should return 400
POST http://localhost:3000/api/watchlist
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer .

{
  "symbol": "CBA",
  "exchange": "ASX",
  "action": "Sell",
  "priority": "Low",
  "alertDirection": "above"
}

### 8. Validation — bad enum, should return 400
POST http://localhost:3000/api/watchlist
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer .

{
  "symbol": "CBA",
  "exchange": "ASX",
  "action": "Hold",
  "priority": "Low"
}